Homepage: https://ziglang.org/

Package: plzig-zig-toolchain
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Zig compiler for PL/Zig (official build, pruned)
 The official Zig compiler release (ziglang.org, SHA-256 pinned by PL/Zig),
 for the PL/Zig procedural language of PostgreSQL. It is installed in
 /usr/libexec/plzig-zig-toolchain/<version>, not on the PATH; the
 postgresql-<major>-plzig packages use it as their default plzig.zig_path.
 .
 The compiler binary is the unchanged upstream build (statically linked, as
 PL/Zig's default Landlock sandbox requires). Its lib/ directory holds only
 the parts PL/Zig needs: Zig's standard library, compiler runtime and test
 runner, no C/C++ library sources or headers.
